 Returns `204 No Content` on success.
 
+## Board Publication
+
+Only account admins (including owners) with access to the board can publish or unpublish it. Board creators who are not admins cannot change publication. Publishing does not change board membership or `all_access`.
+
+### `POST /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Publishes the board. No request body is required. Returns `200 OK` with the board JSON, including its `public_url`. Repeated requests preserve the existing public URL.
+
+### `DELETE /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Unpublishes the board and returns `204 No Content`. The old URL stops working immediately. Publishing again generates a new secret URL.
+
+### Public pages
+
+Anyone with the secret URL can view these read-only HTML pages without signing in:
+
+- `GET /:account_slug/public/boards/:key`
+- `GET /:account_slug/public/boards/:key/columns/:id`
+- `GET /:account_slug/public/boards/:key/cards/:number`
+
+Only published cards are visible; drafts are never shared. Cards and columns must belong to the published board. Invalid or revoked keys return `404 Not Found`.
+
 ## Board Accesses
 
+
 Board accesses let you see who has access to a board and their involvement level (watching or access only). Any board member can view this information.
 
 ### `GET /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/accesses`
diff --git a/test/controllers/boards/publications_controller_test.rb b/test/controllers/boards/publications_controller_test.rb
